{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31366","headline":"和绵州于中丞登越王楼作 · 李汶濡","name":"和绵州于中丞登越王楼作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"珍重巴西守，殷勤寄远情。\n劒峰当户碧，诗韵满楼清。\n日照涪川阔，烟笼雪峤明。\n徵黄看即及，莫叹滞江城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李汶濡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31366.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31366","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}